cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this repository, please cite it using these metadata.
title: Token Row Transplants
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - given-names: Sangmi
    family-names: Lee
repository-code: https://github.com/kuflower/token-row-transplants
abstract: >-
  This repository contains the experiments for the MSc thesis When Do Token Rows
  Transfer? Cross-Lingual Token-Row Transplants in Transformer Language Models.
  The code moves complete tied token matrices between compact decoder-only language
  models and measures how the spelling effect changes with training-language match,
  donor run, row-to-token assignment, and model initialization. It also includes
  experiment configurations, result tables, figures, and a results notebook.
keywords:
  - cross-lingual transfer
  - language modeling
  - token embeddings
  - token rows
  - transformer language models
  - weight tying
license: MIT
